      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "d7743bd33a4386ec310c2183a863a959da0c58d97341a473cac60ea09d27fbb2:000002_6470627256886190481:g0:r24",
      "row_index_0based": 24,
      "serialized_row_index": 24,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "僕は急いで台所に向かい、\nリグラーナさんのお皿に、彼女が採ってきた新鮮な虫を乗せる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
